  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_arrow_cbcc0d667c34c125acd9d046e46c630d06eb9e2c3372d1dc95d852f21549f8eb0c">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Projectiles generally consisting of a straight, slender shaft with a sharp point or carrying a sharp edged or pointed head of stone or metal, shot from a bow. More developed versions also have flights near the butt to stabilize their trajectory. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
